<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Acceptance Letter · {{ $submission->submission_number }}</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#eef1f4;color:#172334;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.sheet{box-sizing:border-box;width:210mm;min-height:297mm;margin:20px auto;padding:28mm 25mm;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #bac2ca}.brand{border-bottom:3px solid #d9621c;padding-bottom:18px}.brand small{color:#687789;letter-spacing:.12em}.brand h1{margin:8px 0 0;color:#18315e;font-size:26px}.meta{margin:32px 0 38px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}.subject{font-weight:bold}.body{font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}.paper{margin:24px 0;padding:18px;border-left:4px solid #d9621c;background:#f7f9fb}.signature{margin-top:56px}.actions{width:210mm;margin:0 auto 20px;text-align:right}.actions button{border:0;border-radius:5px;background:#18315e;color:#fff;padding:11px 18px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}@media print{body{background:#fff}.sheet{margin:0;box-shadow:none}.actions{display:none}}</style></head>
<body><div class="actions"><button onclick="window.print()">Print / Save PDF</button></div><main class="sheet"><header class="brand"><small>INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE OF MANAGEMENT</small><h1>{{ $submission->edition?->name ?? 'ICOMAN 2026' }}</h1></header><div class="meta"><div>Reference: {{ $submission->submission_number }}</div><div>Date: {{ $submission->updated_at->format('d F Y') }}</div><div class="subject">Subject: Letter of Acceptance</div></div><div class="body"><p>Dear {{ $submission->authors->first()?->name ?? auth('author')->user()->name }},</p><p>We are pleased to confirm that the following paper has been accepted for presentation at {{ $submission->edition?->name ?? 'ICOMAN 2026' }}:</p><div class="paper"><strong>{{ $submission->title }}</strong><br><span>Submission ID: {{ $submission->submission_number }}</span></div><p>Please complete presenter registration and submit the final manuscript through the author portal. Presentation details will be announced by the conference committee.</p><p>We look forward to your contribution.</p></div><div class="signature"><strong>Conference Committee</strong><br>{{ $submission->edition?->name ?? 'ICOMAN 2026' }}</div></main></body></html>
